      "source": "Advice must be set before using setter methods.\nPointcut will normally be set also, but defaults to <code>Pointcut.TRUE</code>.",
      "translation": "必须在设置 Setter 方法之前设置 Advice。通常也会设置 Pointcut，但其默认值为 `<code>Pointcut.TRUE</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>Pointcut.TRUE</code> will be used as Pointcut.",
      "translation": "<code>Pointcut.TRUE</code> 将用作切面。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This is the most commonly used Advisor implementation. It can be used\nwith any pointcut and advice type, except for introductions. There is\nnormally no need to subclass this class, or to implement custom Advisors.",
      "translation": "这是最常用的 Advisor 实现。它可以与任何切点和通知类型一起使用，除了引入（introductions）。通常无需继承此类或实现自定义 Advisor。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
